title: "Longitudinal Privacy Inference from Public-Sector Transparency Data with Large Language Models"
abstract: >-
  Pipeline and aggregated results for measuring longitudinal privacy
  inference from public-sector administrative data with large language
  models: public-knowledge extraction, longitudinal attribute inference,
  multi-judge validation by majority vote, phishing generation and
  detection.
